	(text "The gain pot (10k dual, audio taper) is on the control board. One shielded 3.5 mm stereo cable per channel connects it to J3 / J4.\nPad 5k6 / 1k brings the hot node down to codec level and limits voltage and current at the Daisy pin. No bias: the Seed has its own input capacitor."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
